cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A2S2-OS — Bench Console"
message: >-
  Use of this software or any derivative requires citing this repository
  (see the Additional Terms in LICENSE.md). Please cite it as below.
abstract: >-
  A2S2-OS is a kiosk "Lab OS" shell: a full-screen bench console that lets a
  bench biologist drive the xArm6 digital twin in plain language, with a
  pluggable app registry for hosting further lab apps.
